    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 31.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðam ælc cyricgrið is Cristes agen grið, and ælc Cristen man ah micle þearfe þæt he on ðam griðe mycle mæþe wite.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Therefore, every church sanctuary is Christ’s own sanctuary, and every Christian has a fundamental responsibility to hold that sanctuary in great reverence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forðam ælc cyricgrið is Cristenes agen grið; 7 ælc Cristen man ah micle þearfe, þæt he on ðam griðe mycle mæþe wite.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
